* r1_isense loop gain, INTERMEDIATE state (az = 1, azh = 0: RF arms at VCM, hold open), zero shunt current
* Generate the `stb` suite decks of r1_isense (T4 follow-up c, 2026-10-21):
* 
*   tb_isense_stbpre.cir   AZ sequence on the channel alone; prints HOLDVALS (hold-cap voltages after the auto-zero)
*   tb_isense_stb.cir      loop gain, NORMAL state (az = azh = 0): hold caps tied at DC to the pre-run values through 1 GH
*                          (open for AC), five breaks (see LOOPS), three shunt levels (0, +100 mV, -20 mV)
*   tb_isense_stbaz.cir    loop gain, AZ CLOSED state (az = azh = 1): output breaks and the AZ servo break at the aux-pair gates
*   tb_isense_stbazi.cir   loop gain, INTERMEDIATE state az = 1, azh = 0 (RF arms at VCM, hold switches open, hold caps
*                          tied at DC to the pre-run values through 1 GH as in the normal state); added in revision 2
*   tb_isense_stbstep.cir  shunt step 0 -> 100 mV, 10 ns edge, real netlist, same load fixture
* 
* Revision 2 (2026-10-21): R1_NET = netlist to read and include (repo-relative, or an absolute path under the results
* root for development variants; default the netlist of record), R1_OUTDIR = directory for the decks (default here).
* 
* Method: Tian double injection, Wiedmann form, as r1_afe (r1_afe/sim/tb_afe_stb.cir, validated on a toy network in
* r1_afe/sim/tb_stb_toy.cir, relative error 4.7e-8):  T = -1/(1-1/(2*(i1*v2-v1*i2)+v1+i2)),  v = driver-side node
* voltage, i = probe-source current, run 1 voltage injection, run 2 current injection; DM/CM from (p -/+ n)/2.
* The probes sit in a deck-local copy of r1_isense_ch (r1_isense_ch_stb) generated from the netlist of record, which is
* included unchanged; no edit of the record.
* 
* Breaks (driver side | load side), all other loops closed:
*   1 dm_out / 2 cm_out  OTA outputs OUTP/OUTN: output devices XMOx/XMLx + Miller Cc (incl. Rz, stage-1 outputs, folding,
*                        aux pair, input pair) | RF arms, CMFB sense, pins (2 pF + comparator gates)
*                        dm_out = main differential loop; cm_out = CM loop incl. the CMFB path and the CM path through
*                        the input pair and the resistor network (the Nyquist-valid CM loop)
*   3 cmfb               CMFB path alone (vcms -> gate of XMF1), other loops closed (informational, not a valid Nyquist
*                        break when the input-pair CM loop is also > 1, as in r1_afe revision C finding 2)
*   4 dm_in / 5 cm_in    input-pair gates sa/sb (resistor network | gates), cross-check of 1 and 2 (normal state)
*   6 dm_aux / 7 cm_aux  aux-pair gates (hold node | gates), the AZ servo (AZ closed state)
* Load fixture = the joint path fixture of r1_safe (tb_safe_joint3.cir): sense outputs drive the thick-PMOS gates of two
* real r1_safe_cmp (OC and NEG of channel a, code THR = 44 on the string, path-fixture muxes) and 2 pF per output.
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib @@MOS@@
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib @@MOS@@
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib @@RES@@
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib @@CAP@@
.temp @@TEMP@@
.include /work/designs/r1-joint/blocks/r1_isense/schematic/r1_isense.spice
.include /work/designs/r1-joint/blocks/r1_safe/schematic/r1_safe.spice
.option gmin=1e-12
Vdda vdda 0 dc @@VDDA@@
Vdd vdd 0 dc @@VDD@@
* IDEAL REFERENCE SOURCES (this step only), as the joint path fixture of r1_safe
Vref vref 0 dc 1.05
Vcm vcm 0 dc 0.6
Iba vdda iba dc {5u*(@@TEMP@@+273.15)/300.15}
Vaz az 0 dc @@VDD@@
Vazh azh 0 dc 0
Vnn isn 0 dc 0
Vin isp isn dc 0
* loop-gain probe parameters (AC magnitudes; all zero except the break under test)
.param vo_p=0 vo_n=0 io_p=0 io_n=0 vi_p=0 vi_n=0 ii_p=0 ii_n=0 vc=0 ic=0 va_p=0 va_n=0 ja_p=0 ja_n=0
.subckt r1_isense_ch_stb isp isn outp outn vref vcm ibias az_lv azh_lv vdda vdd vss
*.ipin isp isn       shunt Kelvin pins (through the analog pads)
*.ipin vref         1.05 V reference for the pedestal (buffered; ideal source in this step)
*.ipin vcm          0.6 V output common mode (from the r1_adc reference; ideal source in this step)
*.ipin ibias        5 uA bias current sunk into this pin's diode (from r1_bgr; ideal source in this step)
*.ipin az_lv azh_lv auto-zero phases, 1.2 V logic from r1_ctrl
*.opin outp outn    differential output to the ADC multiplexer and r1_safe
* ---- level shifters for the AZ phases
XLS1 az_lv vdd vdda vss az azb r1_ls
XLS2 azh_lv vdd vdda vss azh azhb r1_ls
* ---- resistor network, unit RIN = 4 kOhm (rppd w=2 l=30.8)
XRIA isp sa vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRIB isn sb vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
* feedback arms: 14 units each (two-terminal multiple: m units in series written out)
XRFA1 rfoa rfa1 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA2 rfa1 rfa2 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA3 rfa2 rfa3 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA4 rfa3 rfa4 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA5 rfa4 rfa5 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA6 rfa5 rfa6 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA7 rfa6 rfa7 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA8 rfa7 rfa8 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA9 rfa8 rfa9 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA10 rfa9 rfa10 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA11 rfa10 rfa11 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA12 rfa11 rfa12 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA13 rfa12 rfa13 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFA14 rfa13 sa vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB1 rfob rfb1 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB2 rfb1 rfb2 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB3 rfb2 rfb3 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB4 rfb3 rfb4 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB5 rfb4 rfb5 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB6 rfb5 rfb6 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB7 rfb6 rfb7 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB8 rfb7 rfb8 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB9 rfb8 rfb9 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB10 rfb9 rfb10 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB11 rfb10 rfb11 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB12 rfb11 rfb12 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB13 rfb12 rfb13 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRFB14 rfb13 sb vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
* pedestal: RP = 26 RIN units (104 kOhm) from vref into sb (ISN side), matching RP from sa to vss;
* VPED = 1.05 V / 26 = 40.38 mV, set by a unit ratio only
XRPB1 vref rpb1 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB2 rpb1 rpb2 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB3 rpb2 rpb3 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB4 rpb3 rpb4 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB5 rpb4 rpb5 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB6 rpb5 rpb6 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB7 rpb6 rpb7 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB8 rpb7 rpb8 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB9 rpb8 rpb9 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB10 rpb9 rpb10 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB11 rpb10 rpb11 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB12 rpb11 rpb12 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB13 rpb12 rpb13 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB14 rpb13 rpb14 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB15 rpb14 rpb15 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB16 rpb15 rpb16 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB17 rpb16 rpb17 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRPB18 rpb17 rpb18 vss rppd w=2u l=30.8u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
